{{fbdoc item="title" value="__FB_S390X__"}}----
Intrinsic define set by the compiler

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}##
	""__FB_S390X__""
##
{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	Define created at compile time if the compilation target uses the s390x CPU architecture, otherwise undefined.

{{fbdoc item="ex"}}
%%(freebasic)
#IFDEF __FB_S390X__
  '...instructions for s390x targets...
#ELSE
  '...instructions for other targets...
#ENDIF
%%

{{fbdoc item="ver"}}
	- Since fbc 1.20.1

{{fbdoc item="diff"}}
	- New to ""FreeBASIC""

{{fbdoc item="see"}}
	- ##[[KeyPgDdFBBigEndian|__FB_BIGENDIAN__]]##
	- ##[[KeyPgDdfb64bit|__FB_64BIT__]]##
	- ##[[KeyPgDdfblinux|__FB_LINUX__]]##
	- [[CompilerOpttarget|Compiler Option: -target]]

